Note playing with lists end note.
Make a list called scores holding 5, 10, 15.
Add 20 to scores.
Say text The scores are end text, scores.
Say text The first score is end text, the first item of scores.
Say text The last score is end text, the last item of scores.
Set item 2 of scores to 99.
Say text After changing item 2, it is end text, item 2 of scores.
Sort scores.
Say text Sorted, they are end text, scores.
Reverse scores.
Say text Backwards, they are end text, scores.
Remove the last item from scores.
Say text After removing the last one, end text, the length of scores, text remain. end text
Make a list called grid holding a list holding 1, 2, a list holding 3, 4.
Say text Item 2 of item 1 of the grid is end text, item 2 of item 1 of grid.
If scores contains 99, then
  Say text The list has a 99 in it. end text
end if.
